style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">01 July 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>7. How can I apply for Lakshmibai College Delhi Various Non Teaching Post Exam?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_23815\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-23815\" style=\"width: 1522px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23815\" title=\"Lakshmibai College Delhi Recruitment\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201532%201017'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"LCD Non Teaching Post 2026\" width=\"1532\" height=\"1017\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LCD-Non-Teaching-Post-2026.jpg 1532w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LCD-Non-Teaching-Post-2026-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LCD-Non-Teaching-Post-2026-1024x680.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LCD-Non-Teaching-Post-2026-768x510.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1532px) 100vw, 1532px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LCD-Non-Teaching-Post-2026.jpg\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23815\" title=\"Lakshmibai College Delhi Recruitment\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LCD-Non-Teaching-Post-2026.jpg\" alt=\"LCD Non Teaching Post